# Per-tick scoring pass (port of _root_class:update_scores), run from song/tick while playing.
# Cap (update_scores:1), fail check (:58) and multiplier growth (:59) are score-only; the old 51-line
# HealthPoints->50-slab-bar rewrite is kept line-for-line below (old re-rendered every tick; at most one
# line matches, so cost is 51 score tests like 1.18).
execute if score #GLOBAL bs_health matches 100.. run scoreboard players set #GLOBAL bs_health 100
# Combo/multiplier displays need no per-tick work: their text_displays carry live score components
# (the modern direct equivalent of the old birch-sign Text1 copy, update_scores:5-16).
# 51-bar render (old update_scores:34-84)
